export anchor InkHeaderBandStyle:
    number: 199
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Ink header band
    idea: A strong ink-navy header band carries the navigation, the greeting and the four headline figures, and a quiet light body below holds the work.
    base: light
    palette:
        ink: #142030, the header band and the primary button
        inkRaised: #1d2b3e, the search field on the band
        inkLine: #3a4d66, rules and outlines on the band
        onInk: #ffffff, headings, figures and the current nav on the band
        onInkMuted: #b9c5d4, labels, the date and idle nav on the band
        coral: #ffab99, the overdue line and overdue figure on the band
        page: #f4f5f7, the light body
        surface: #ffffff, panels and the style sheet
        line: #dce1e7, panel borders and row rules
        text: #17202b, body text
        muted: #535e6d, meta and table headings
        blue: #1f5bbf, links, progress fills, this week bars and focus
        lastWeek: #7f8a9b, last week bars
        ok: #1a6f3f, On track with a check circle
        risk: #8a5000, At risk with a triangle
        behind: #b0261c, Behind with a crossed square
    type:
        One stack, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, sans-serif. The greeting is 40px bold at minus 0.02em
        on the band, band figures 44px at 650 with tabular numbers, panel
        titles 16px bold, row names 15px at 650, body 15px at 1.5, table
        headings 12px caps at 0.06em and meta 13px.
    layout:
        A full width ink band runs across the top. Its first row, under a
        thin rule, holds a white square B mark with the brand, six nav links
        with Home underlined in white, a dark search field, a white New
        project button, an outlined bell and the initials disc with Mara
        Okafor. Below sit the date, a large white greeting and a coral line
        with a clock saying 4 tasks are overdue plus a Review overdue tasks
        link, with a small right aligned note of 78 of 170 tasks done. The
        band ends with four figures in a row split by vertical rules, each a
        small label, a big number and a note, the overdue one coral with a
        clock. The light body below is a two column grid. The wide left
        column is a white bordered panel with a five column projects table
        of name and team, a thin progress bar with percent, tasks, due date
        with days left and status. The narrow right column stacks a chart
        panel with three totals over grouped bars, last week and this week
        side by side for each weekday, and an activity panel of rows with
        initials discs. Below 1000px the nav drops to its own row and the
        body stacks. On phones the figures become a two by two grid and
        table rows turn into stacked cards.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px gutters, 24px between panels, 20px panel padding and 40px above the greeting.
    density: Medium. The band is spacious and the body is a compact six row table.
    corners: 6px on panels, buttons and fields, 3px bars, round avatars.
    borders: 1px #dce1e7 around panels and between rows. 1px #3a4d66 rules on the band.
    shadows: None. Depth comes only from the dark band over the light body.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.8 stroke sized to the text. Status words in colour
        with a check circle, a triangle or a crossed square, and a clock
        for overdue.
    focus: A 2px blue outline offset 2px in the body and a 2px white outline on the band.
    tone: Plain and direct, such as Projects, 4 tasks are overdue and Review overdue tasks.
